WillowTree Web is a TypeScript port of WillowTree# (GPL-3.0).
See LICENSE.

WillowTree# was created by XanderChaos.
WSG format research by matt911, Turk645, and XanderChaos.
X360 class by DJ Shepherd.
Major revisions by JackSchitt, matt911, da_fileserver, CK Y, mphjens,
and GOTY Enhanced work in WillowTreeBLDEnhanced by Nicolas Constanty.

STFS/CON open and save in this port follows the WillowTree# / X360 approach
(GPL-3.0, plus the additional terms in X360.COPYING.TXT from the original
project). Console private keys are not used. Some Xbox 360 consoles still
need a tool such as Horizon or Modio to rehash/resign a package, as with
the desktop editor.

